sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as ZKT Device
    participant A as API Server
    participant DB as Database

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over D, A: HTTPS (TLS 1.3)
        D->>A: POST /api/v1/attendance/sync
        Note right of D: Headers:<br/>Authorization: Bearer PSK<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over A: Validate Hardware-Specific Pre-Shared Key
        A->>A: Authenticate Bearer Token
    end

    alt Valid Token
        rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
            Note over A, DB: Process Attendance Record
            A->>DB: Insert Attendance Record
            DB-->>A: Record Saved
        end

        rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
            Note over A, D: Success Response
            A-->>D: HTTP 201 Created
            Note right of A: Body: { "status": "success", "logged": true }
        end
    else Invalid Token
        A-->>D: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
    end